### ADS Dental Surgeries Appointments REST API

# Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/adsweb/api/v1

### 1. GET All Patients (Sorted by lastName ASC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/patients
Accept: application/json

### 2. GET Patient by ID (Valid ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/patients/1
Accept: application/json

### 3. GET Patient by ID (Invalid ID - Exception Handling)
GET {{baseUrl}}/patients/999
Accept: application/json

### 4. POST Register New Patient
POST {{baseUrl}}/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Diana",
  "lastName": "Prince",
  "contactPhone": "555-5555",
  "email": "diana.p@amazon.com",
  "dateOfBirth": "1988-06-15",
  "outstandingBillBalance": 0.00,
  "address": {
    "street": "123 Wonder Way",
    "city": "Themyscira",
    "state": "Paradise Island",
    "zipCode": "00000"
  }
}

### 5. PUT Update Patient (Singular URI)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/patient/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Alice",
  "lastName": "Williams-Smith",
  "contactPhone": "555-8888",
  "email": "alice.smith@email.com",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-05-14",
  "outstandingBillBalance": 50.00,
  "address": {
    "street": "123 Elm St",
    "city": "Austin",
    "state": "TX",
    "zipCode": "78701"
  }
}

### 6. DELETE Patient (Singular URI)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/patient/3

### 7. GET Search Patients (Singular URI)
GET {{baseUrl}}/patient/search/Bob

### 8. GET All Addresses (Sorted by city ASC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/addresses
Accept: application/json
